00:47:00,150 --> 00:47:01,561
So it is.

813
00:47:01,585 --> 00:47:04,065
I remembered something to do
suddenly, so I'm going home!

814
00:47:06,456 --> 00:47:08,697
Money, what's it for?

815
00:47:09,493 --> 00:47:11,097
To buy the stamp?

816
00:47:11,161 --> 00:47:13,573
Didn't you give up to collect
the stamps?

817
00:47:14,698 --> 00:47:17,178
Mom said 'In either case you'll say
not to want to collect anymore'.

818
00:47:17,201 --> 00:47:20,273
Don't do anything needless'

819
00:47:20,337 --> 00:47:22,715
I feel that it stands to reason!

820
00:47:22,739 --> 00:47:27,688
But how shameful! I have no
any collection to be proud!

821
00:47:28,812 --> 00:47:29,790
Right!

822
00:47:29,813 --> 00:47:32,384
Don't you have some outstanding
collection?

823
00:47:32,449 --> 00:47:33,359
Are you pointing me?

824
00:47:33,383 --> 00:47:34,623
Yes!

825
00:47:37,120 --> 00:47:40,192
When and what have I collected?

826
00:47:40,257 --> 00:47:42,134
Well!

827
00:47:42,159 --> 00:47:44,196
What, it's a bottle cover!

828
00:47:44,261 --> 00:47:47,105
Idiot, you're laughing at me
with such thing?

829
00:47:47,130 --> 00:47:48,700
Not at all!

830
00:47:48,765 --> 00:47:51,507
How do you decide the value of
something?

831
00:47:51,535 --> 00:47:55,005
In the end it's decided by
that people want it or not!

832
00:47:55,439 --> 00:47:59,080
At the beginning if people didn't
want the stamps and jewels,

833
00:47:59,142 --> 00:48:01,748
they would be some ordinary paper and
stones.

834
00:48:01,812 --> 00:48:04,554
And...So...what do you want to say?

835
00:48:05,282 --> 00:48:07,455
I want to monkey tricks!

836
00:48:07,751 --> 00:48:11,460
The epidemical virus.

837
00:48:11,488 --> 00:48:14,435
What? Didn't we use it before?

838
00:48:14,458 --> 00:48:15,869
Yes!

839
00:48:15,893 --> 00:48:17,964
What's it for?

840
00:48:18,528 --> 00:48:21,008
This virus can be born only in 1 minute.

841
00:48:21,031 --> 00:48:24,069
During this time, you need to say
what you hope to be popular.

842
00:48:24,134 --> 00:48:27,638
Collecting Bottle Cover

843
00:48:27,704 --> 00:48:29,308
So it is!

844
00:48:31,675 --> 00:48:34,212
Then spreading it by wind.

845
00:48:34,511 --> 00:48:37,117
It'll act well at once!

846
00:48:38,482 --> 00:48:40,393
I'm going out to take a view.

847
00:48:40,417 --> 00:48:42,829
Look. . . I've collected 3.

848
00:48:42,853 --> 00:48:45,197
I've collected 5.

849
00:48:45,222 --> 00:48:48,066
But I've collected one dozen.

850
00:48:48,091 --> 00:48:49,536
One dozen!

851
00:48:49,559 --> 00:48:51,129
Have a look, what I collected.

852
00:48:51,194 --> 00:48:52,969
The printing is skew.

853
00:48:52,996 --> 00:48:54,976
Such things will be very valuable.

854
00:48:54,998 --> 00:48:57,478
You're so awesome that you could
collect such thing.

855
00:48:58,201 --> 00:48:59,509
Really foolish!

856
00:48:59,536 --> 00:49:03,245
Everyone doesn't know that they've
caught the epidemical virus.

857
00:49:03,874 --> 00:49:07,253
What do you collect these things for?

858
00:49:07,277 --> 00:49:08,756
Don't touch them!

859
00:49:08,779 --> 00:49:10,850
You should use the clamp.

860
00:49:10,914 --> 00:49:13,656
In case that the bottle covers would
get rusty.

861
00:49:13,684 --> 00:49:16,528
This guy can't yet catch up
with the fashion.

862
00:49:16,553 --> 00:49:18,362
It's very popular for now to collect
this.

863
00:49:18,388 --> 00:49:20,834
It has been outdated to collect
the stamps or coins.

864
00:49:21,391 --> 00:49:24,634
Look at the beautiful form and
the interesting pattern!

865
00:49:24,661 --> 00:49:27,232
You won't get boring, even
watching it for one whole day.

866
00:49:27,731 --> 00:49:31,907
To collect the bottle covers will create
the worldwide fashion right away.

867
00:49:32,703 --> 00:49:36,344
Never thought it would be so serious.
The effective is really awesome.

868
00:49:37,007 --> 00:49:38,748
Nobita, what did you say?

869
00:49:38,775 --> 00:49:40,311
Nothing!

870
00:49:40,377 --> 00:49:43,153
Right, everyone, come to my home!

871
00:49:50,287 --> 00:49:52,767
All of these are Nobita's collection?

872
00:49:52,789 --> 00:49:54,063
When did you collect them?

873
00:49:54,091 --> 00:49:56,037
Nothing splendid!

874
00:49:56,059 --> 00:49:59,597
Just I've noticed something different
from yours.

875
00:50:00,630 --> 00:50:02,906
Because Nobita's thought is very
advanced!

876
00:50:03,233 --> 00:50:04,473
I give up!

877
00:50:04,501 --> 00:50:05,571
All right!

878
00:50:05,635 --> 00:50:07,205
Hurry to collect!

879
00:50:09,239 --> 00:50:10,718
Really interesting!

880
00:50:10,774 --> 00:50:12,754
I'm in a very good mood! Doraemon

881
00:50:13,343 --> 00:50:15,914
Mom, I'll beg you only this time in my
life!

882
00:50:16,680 --> 00:50:20,287
From today on let's replace all the
snacks and meals with Coca-cola!

883
00:50:25,422 --> 00:50:27,925
Finally I've collected more than
10 bottle covers.

884
00:50:27,991 --> 00:50:30,562
But I nearly spited out Coca-cola
when I was hiccupping.

885
00:50:31,661 --> 00:50:33,732
Next I'm going to collect the bottle
covers of the carbonated drinks.

886
00:50:34,664 --> 00:50:36,473
Please drink to the top of your bend!

887
00:50:36,500 --> 00:50:38,844
You opened so many bottles,
how can I drink up?

888
00:50:39,236 --> 00:50:40,579
I got 26!

889
00:50:40,604 --> 00:50:41,582
I got 50!

890
00:50:41,638 --> 00:50:44,448
No...you don't know the method
for collecting at all.

891
00:50:44,474 --> 00:50:47,045
It has no any significance to only
collect many.

892
00:50:47,110 --> 00:50:48,088
Yes!

893
00:50:48,145 --> 00:50:51,957
In despite of the stamps or anything
else, a little will be money's worth.

894
00:50:51,982 --> 00:50:53,757
Is that so?

895
00:50:53,784 --> 00:50:56,560
For example, among Nobita's collection,

896
00:50:56,586 --> 00:50:59,999
the bottle cover of Coca-cola which he
bought at Sankowu on 12th August...

897
00:51:00,023 --> 00:51:02,162
is the only one in the world
among those...

898
00:51:02,225 --> 00:51:05,331
were sold at Sankowu at that day.

899
00:51:05,395 --> 00:51:09,366
1 million Yen, no, even you pay
10 million, you won't buy it.

900
00:51:10,434 --> 00:51:12,471
Really interesting!

901
00:51:13,203 --> 00:51:15,183
Everyone started to collect the bottle
covers.

902
00:51:15,238 --> 00:51:16,216
Yes!

903
00:51:16,273 --> 00:51:18,275
Nobita, a gift for you!

904
00:51:18,341 --> 00:51:21,220
This is a bottle cover of some sport
drink. It values <i>2</i> thousand Yen!

905
00:51:21,244 --> 00:51:22,450
What?

906
00:51:22,479 --> 00:51:25,949
The virus seems spreading very seriously
Even Papa has caught it.

907
00:51:26,016 --> 00:51:28,018
How long will the effective last?

908
00:51:29,419 --> 00:51:31,956
It's almost time to finish it.

909
00:51:32,022 --> 00:51:34,628
Nobita is in for sure!

910
00:51:34,691 --> 00:51:38,138
I'm collecting the Bottle Covers
specially.

911
00:51:38,161 --> 00:51:40,732
Just because of the rumor I came to
visit you.

912
00:51:40,797 --> 00:51:43,277
It's heard that you got
a splendid bottle cover.

913
00:51:44,301 --> 00:51:48,477
For the bottle cover of the Coca-cola
you bought at Sankowu on 12th August

914
00:51:48,505 --> 00:51:51,384
I'll pay <i>2</i> million Yen to you.

915
00:51:51,408 --> 00:51:53,979
What, <i>2</i> million?

916
00:51:54,044 --> 00:51:55,751
I can't sell it to you.

917
00:51:55,779 --> 00:51:57,156
You dislike the price?

918
00:51:57,180 --> 00:51:59,023
Then 3 million!

919
00:51:59,049 --> 00:52:01,051
How can it be?!

920
00:52:01,118 --> 00:52:02,529
You won't?

921
00:52:02,552 --> 00:52:04,998
So 5 million!

922
00:52:05,755 --> 00:52:07,757
Then 7 million?

923
00:52:08,525 --> 00:52:10,061
8 million!

924
00:52:10,393 --> 00:52:12,634
How about a check of 10 million?

925
00:52:13,463 --> 00:52:16,467
Is it enough? Yep!

926
00:52:18,101 --> 00:52:21,344
Thank you, I bought it finally!

927
00:52:21,605 --> 00:52:24,643
Was it good to sell that 10 million Yen?

928
00:52:32,048 --> 00:52:35,393
Why did I pay 10 million Yen for
such a thing?

929
00:52:35,418 --> 00:52:37,398
Really something wrong with me!

930
00:52:37,787 --> 00:52:40,233
The effective of the virus has
finished up.

931
00:52:40,257 --> 00:52:43,033
Feels very regrettable!
But also feels relaxed.

932
00:52:43,059 --> 00:52:45,005
This result is really too good.

933
00:52:45,028 --> 00:52:46,666
Sure it is!

